WEBVTT

01:02:28.833 --> 01:02:31.476
on this set of commitments
or expectations,

01:02:31.500 --> 01:02:33.226
that was never there to begin with.

01:02:33.250 --> 01:02:34.976
We were never a family.

01:02:35.000 --> 01:02:37.184
You were never working
on a meaningful cause,

01:02:37.208 --> 01:02:38.684
I never owed you a paycheck."

01:02:38.708 --> 01:02:40.661
And I think that might be the difference.

01:02:40.685 --> 01:02:43.601
I have no idea what to do with that,
but that was my thought.

01:02:44.333 --> 01:02:45.601
EP: That's beautiful.

01:02:45.625 --> 01:02:47.976
I mean, it's an element of gaslighting.

01:02:48.000 --> 01:02:50.309
Basically, you know, you're crazy.

01:02:50.333 --> 01:02:53.375
You're crazy for even thinking this
in the first place.

01:02:54.375 --> 01:02:55.625
Yes.

01:02:56.583 --> 01:02:59.976
Woman 3: How do you know
whether to leave or stay

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:01.559
in the work context?